# The engine's builtin `configuration` worker persists any config it
# resolves through its fs adapter to `./config/<id>.yaml`, relative to CWD
# (engine/src/workers/configuration/adapters/fs.rs's DEFAULT_DIRECTORY, in
# the iii engine repo) — observed locally for `iii-observability`.
# run-tests.sh removes this directory before each run; ignore it too in case
# a run is interrupted before that cleanup fires on the next one.
/config/
